Error [E0107]: Nothing named `nonexistent_var` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_typo_dropped.jet:10:17
    |
 10 |         print("{nonexistent_var}")
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Declare it first: `nonexistent_var :: ...`
